    "content": {
      "component": "blog_article",
      "sharepoint_id": "89",
      "title": "No AI Without Talent: It's Time to Build a Pipeline",
      "description": "Kenya leads East Africa's digital rise, but an AI skills gap threatens progress. Urgent investment in youth-focused AI education is key to seizing the opportunity.",
      "date": "Sep 01, 2025",
      "read_time": "2 min read",
      "author": "Farhana Alarakhiya",
      "isGlobal": true,
      "banner_image": {
        "fieldtype": "asset"
      },
      "thumbnail": {
        "fieldtype": "asset"
      },
      "languages": [],
      "show_share": true,
      "show_similar": true,
      "similar_show_header": true,
      "category": "",
      "isFeatured": null,
      "body": [
        {
          "component": "rich_text",
          "content": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "East Africa is on the brink of a digital transformation. Kenya, often hailed as the region's innovation hub, is leading the charge; from mobile money to AI-powered health diagnostics. But behind this promise lies a serious risk: "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "a growing AI skills gap that could leave an entire generation behind.",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Data",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "hard_break"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The numbers are clear.",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " Africa's digital economy is set to grow from 5.2% of GDP in 2025 to 8.5% by 2050. In Kenya, digital innovation already drives progress across finance, agriculture, and education. "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Yet 43% of Kenyan organizations expect a major gap in AI talent needs in 2025,",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " and many are unprepared. The talent crunch is real. Across the continent, "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "9 in 10 companies report that the lack of AI skills is slowing them down:",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " delayed projects, failed innovations, and lost business. In Kenya, firms are already losing contracts to better-equipped competitors. It's a warning sign for a country that sees itself as a digital leader. The talent pipeline is too narrow and competitive. "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Of the 2,400 AI-focused companies in Africa, only 204 are in Kenya,",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " significantly less than "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "South Africa (726)",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " and "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Nigeria (456).",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " Without serious investment, Kenya and its neighbours risk being left behind, not just in using AI, but in owning and shaping its future."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Opportunity",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "But there's hope. "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "We have a strategic advantage: YOUTH. Over 75% of Kenya's population is under 35.",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " But with youth unemployment high, we're wasting our greatest asset and a generation full of potential. The fix? "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "AI education as a lever for inclusion, economic growth, and global competitiveness.",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " Employers are calling for skills in:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "bullet_list",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "AI development (85%)"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Generative AI (83%)"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Cybersecurity (86%)"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Cloud Computing (79%)"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "These are not luxury skills. They're essential and teachable.",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "This is a call to governments: "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Prioritize AI education. Not tomorrow. Today!",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "What must happen",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "bold"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Governments, educators, and the private sector must align on a national AI skills agenda:"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "bullet_list",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Invest in regional centers of excellence."
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Build public-private training models."
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "list_item",
                    "content": [
                      {
                        "type": "paragraph",
                        "content": [
                          {
                            "type": "text",
                            "text": "Expand AI apprenticeships and industry partnerships."
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The youth are ready. The private sector is waiting. What's missing is coordinated, decisive leadership."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Kenya can lead the continent, if we act now. The window is narrow, but the opportunity is ours to seize. This is the moment to invest in AI and digital skills, empower the next generation, and secure our role as Africa's digital leader. "
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "How is your organization contributing to closing the AI skills gap? What more could you do if governments and industry aligned on this vision?"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Source: "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Africa's AI Skills Readiness Report - SAP",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "link",
                        "attrs": {
                          "href": "https://online.flippingbook.com/view/478161039/i/",
                          "target": "_self",
                          "linktype": "url",
                          "uuid": null,
                          "anchor": null,
                          "custom": {}
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "#AKUData #DataForGood"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "hard_break"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
